%% Warrant gate sequence — rendered PNG: ../03-warrant-gate-sequence.png
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant IO as Investigating Officer
    participant WG as Warrant Gate
    participant SP as Senior Officer (SP+)
    participant L as Warrant Ledger (hash-chained)

    IO->>WG: request warrant — scope, reason, expiry
    WG->>SP: forward for countersign
    Note over SP: self-approval REJECTED in code<br/>(four-eyes principle)
    SP->>WG: dual-sign warrant
    WG->>IO: unmask — scoped · expiring · revocable
    WG->>L: every event hash-chained
    Note over L: /api/warrants/verify names<br/>first tampered record
